WEBVTT

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.884
To je poslednja, i mislim
i najlepša lekcija

00:17:02.908 --> 00:17:04.243
Hauarda Moskovica:

00:17:04.267 --> 00:17:07.976
prihvatanjem različitosti ljudskih bića,

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.640
pronaći ćemo sigurniji put
do istinske sreće.

00:17:10.769 --> 00:17:11.786
Hvala vam.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:12.976
(Aplauz)